#: src/languages.md:3
msgid ""
"goat speaks your language. Its human-facing text — errors, the `doctor` and "
"`status` readouts, the `--help` screens — is translated into **all 28 NATO-"
"member languages plus Ukrainian**."
msgstr ""
"goat taler dit sprog. Dens menneskevendte tekst — fejl, `doctor`- og "
"`status`-aflæsningerne, `--help`-skærmene — er oversat til **alle 28 NATO-"
"medlemssprog plus ukrainsk**."

#: src/languages.md:5
msgid "Choosing a language"
msgstr "Valg af sprog"

#: src/languages.md:7
msgid "goat picks a language in this order:"
msgstr "goat vælger et sprog i denne rækkefølge:"

#: src/languages.md:9
msgid "the `--lang` flag (`goat --lang fr doctor`),"
msgstr "flaget `--lang` (`goat --lang fr doctor`),"

#: src/languages.md:10
msgid "the `GOAT_LANG` environment variable (`export GOAT_LANG=uk`),"
msgstr "miljøvariablen `GOAT_LANG` (`export GOAT_LANG=uk`),"

#: src/languages.md:11
msgid "your operating system's locale,"
msgstr "dit operativsystems lokalitet,"

#: src/languages.md:12
msgid "English."
msgstr "engelsk."

#: src/languages.md:15
msgid "# just this command, in German\n"
msgstr "# kun denne kommando, på tysk\n"

#: src/languages.md:16
msgid "# everything, in French, for this shell\n"
msgstr "# alt, på fransk, for denne shell\n"

#: src/languages.md:19
msgid ""
"English is the authoritative source: if a phrase hasn't been translated yet, "
"goat shows the English rather than a blank."
msgstr ""
"Engelsk er den autoritative kilde: hvis en frase endnu ikke er oversat, "
"viser goat den engelske frem for en tom."

#: src/languages.md:21
msgid "What stays the same in every language"
msgstr "Hvad der forbliver det samme på alle sprog"

#: src/languages.md:23
msgid ""
"The **machine surface never changes**. `--json` field values, error codes "
"(`E_OFF_MESH`, …), exit codes, command and flag names, and contract tokens "
"(paths, keys, URLs) are byte-for-byte identical no matter the language. "
"Translate the prose, not the contract — so your scripts work the same for "
"every operator."
msgstr ""
"**Maskinoverfladen ændrer sig aldrig**. `--json`-feltværdier, fejlkoder "
"(`E_OFF_MESH`, …), exit-koder, kommando- og flagnavne samt kontrakt-tokens "
"(stier, nøgler, URL'er) er byte-for-byte identiske uanset sproget. Oversæt "
"prosaen, ikke kontrakten — så dine scripts fungerer ens for hver operatør."

#: src/languages.md:25
msgid "A note on machine-translated text"
msgstr "En bemærkning om maskinoversat tekst"

#: src/languages.md:27
msgid ""
"Most translations are machine-produced and awaiting native-speaker review. "
"When you run goat in one of those languages, it prints a short, one-time "
"notice on standard error telling you the text is machine-translated, that "
"the English is authoritative, and where to report a translation error. "
"Suppress it with `GOAT_I18N_NO_WARN=1`."
msgstr ""
"De fleste oversættelser er maskinproducerede og afventer gennemgang af en "
"indfødt taler. Når du kører goat på et af disse sprog, udskriver den en kort "
"engangsmeddelelse på standardfejl, der fortæller dig, at teksten er "
"maskinoversat, at engelsk er autoritativt, og hvor du kan rapportere en "
"oversættelsesfejl. Undertryk den med `GOAT_I18N_NO_WARN=1`."

#: src/languages.md:29
msgid ""
"If you speak one of these languages and spot something off, that report is "
"genuinely welcome — it's how the catalogs get better."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du taler et af disse sprog og opdager noget galt, er den rapport "
"oprigtigt velkommen — det er sådan, katalogerne bliver bedre."

#: src/languages.md:31
msgid "And one for fun"
msgstr "Og ét for sjov"

#: src/languages.md:33
msgid ""
"`goat --lang tlh` renders the marquee lines in **Klingon**. It's an opt-in "
"easter egg — never selected automatically — and, like every other locale, it "
"can't touch the machine surface. Qapla'."
msgstr ""
"`goat --lang tlh` gengiver overskriftslinjerne på **klingonsk**. Det er et "
"opt-in-påskeæg — vælges aldrig automatisk — og kan, som enhver anden "
"lokalitet, ikke røre maskinoverfladen. Qapla'."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:3
msgid "When something's wrong, start with one command:"
msgstr "Når noget er galt, så start med én kommando:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:9
msgid ""
"It runs four steps in order and, for any that fails, prints a specific fix. "
"Here's how to read it."
msgstr ""
"Den kører fire trin i rækkefølge og udskriver, for ethvert der fejler, en "
"specifik rettelse. Sådan læser du den."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:11
msgid "Reading `goat doctor`"
msgstr "Læsning af `goat doctor`"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "Step"
msgstr "Trin"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "What it checks"
msgstr "Hvad det tjekker"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "If it fails"
msgstr "Hvis det fejler"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "**mesh**"
msgstr "**mesh**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "You're on the fabric's network"
msgstr "Du er på fabrics netværk"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "You're off-mesh — bring up your tunnel (`netbird status` / re-enroll)"
msgstr "Du er off-mesh — bring din tunnel op (`netbird status` / tilmeld igen)"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid "**router**"
msgstr "**router**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid "The fabric's router is reachable"
msgstr "Fabrics router kan nås"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid ""
"The router may be down, or your endpoint is wrong — re-check your profile"
msgstr ""
"Routeren kan være nede, eller dit endpoint er forkert — tjek din profil igen"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "**certificate**"
msgstr "**certifikat**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "Your identity is accepted"
msgstr "Din identitet accepteres"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid ""
"Your cert may be expired or rejected — `goat profile show`, then re-onboard "
"if needed"
msgstr ""
"Dit certifikat kan være udløbet eller afvist — `goat profile show`, og "
"tilmeld derefter igen, hvis nødvendigt"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "**portal**"
msgstr "**portal**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "Your access token works"
msgstr "Dit adgangstoken virker"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "Token expired or revoked — ask to be re-onboarded"
msgstr "Token udløbet eller tilbagekaldt — bed om at blive tilmeldt igen"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:20
msgid ""
"Each failed step exits with a distinct code, so a wrapper script can branch "
"without parsing text."
msgstr ""
"Hvert fejlet trin afslutter med en særskilt kode, så et wrapper-script kan "
"forgrene sig uden at parse tekst."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:22
msgid "Common situations"
msgstr "Almindelige situationer"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:24
msgid ""
"**\"off the ZTOL — not connected to the mesh\"** You're not on the fabric's "
"network. Bring up your mesh tunnel and try again; `goat doctor` will confirm "
"once you're on."
msgstr ""
"**\"off the ZTOL — not connected to the mesh\"** Du er ikke på fabrics "
"netværk. Bring din mesh-tunnel op og prøv igen; `goat doctor` bekræfter, når "
"du er på."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:27
msgid ""
"**\"mTLS cert expired or rejected by the router\"** Your identity is stale. "
"`goat profile show` to see its expiry; if it's past, you'll need a fresh "
"bundle."
msgstr ""
"**\"mTLS cert expired or rejected by the router\"** Din identitet er "
"forældet. `goat profile show` for at se dens udløb; hvis det er overskredet, "
"har du brug for et nyt bundle."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:30
msgid ""
"**\"portal rejected the Bearer token\"** Your access token is no longer "
"valid (expired or revoked). Ask your administrator to re-onboard you."
msgstr ""
"**\"portal rejected the Bearer token\"** Dit adgangstoken er ikke længere "
"gyldigt (udløbet eller tilbagekaldt). Bed din administrator om at tilmelde "
"dig igen."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:33
msgid ""
"**`goat status` shows a `[✗]`** `status` is the one-glance view; run `goat "
"doctor` for the stepped detail and the specific remedy."
msgstr ""
"**`goat status` viser et `[✗]`** `status` er overblikket på ét blik; kør "
"`goat doctor` for den trinvise detalje og den specifikke afhjælpning."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:36
msgid ""
"**`goat status` shows `ztol` green but `session` red** The router port accepts connections, but a Zenoh session does not open: the router is wedged, or it rejects your certificate. A mesh bounce does not fix this. Run `goat doctor` and tell your administrator."
msgstr ""
"**`goat status` viser `ztol` grøn, men `session` rød** Routerens port tager imod forbindelser, men en Zenoh-session åbner ikke: routeren er gået i stå, eller den afviser dit certifikat. En genstart af mesh-forbindelsen løser det ikke. Kør `goat doctor` og giv din administrator besked."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:39
msgid "Understanding an error code"
msgstr "Forståelse af en fejlkode"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:38
msgid "Every error carries a stable code (like `E_OFF_MESH`). To look one up:"
msgstr "Hver fejl bærer en stabil kode (som `E_OFF_MESH`). For at slå en op:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:44
msgid "Practice without risk"
msgstr "Øv uden risiko"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:46
msgid ""
"If you just want to explore commands without touching anything real, the "
"sandbox is always there:"
msgstr ""
"Hvis du bare vil udforske kommandoer uden at røre noget ægte, er sandboxen "
"altid der:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:53
msgid "Still stuck?"
msgstr "Sidder du stadig fast?"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:55
msgid ""
"Capture the exact command and its output (use `--json` for a clean, complete "
"record) and bring it to your goat administrator."
msgstr ""
"Fang den nøjagtige kommando og dens output (brug `--json` for en ren, "
"fuldstændig optegnelse), og bring den til din goat-administrator."

#: src/admin.md:3
msgid ""
"`goat admin` is the operator surface: onboarding and revoking participants, "
"rotating certificates, cutting a misbehaving peer off the mesh, provisioning "
"devices, and LAN-side triage. It sits apart from the everyday commands on "
"purpose."
msgstr ""
"`goat admin` er operatørfladen: onboarding og tilbagekaldelse af deltagere, "
"rotation af certifikater, afskæring af en fejlende peer fra mesh-nettet, "
"klargøring af enheder og LAN-side triage. Den er bevidst adskilt fra "
"hverdagskommandoerne."

#: src/admin.md:5
msgid ""
"**Operator-only.** These commands are for operators who hold admin "
"credentials. If you're a participant publishing and subscribing on the "
"fabric, this chapter isn't your day-to-day — your surface is **[Everyday "
"tasks](everyday.md)** (`goat pub` / `sub` / `top` / `who` / `health`). `goat "
"admin` is **inert for non-admins**: an unauthorized call changes nothing and "
"tells you so."
msgstr ""
"**Kun for operatører.** Disse kommandoer er til operatører med admin-"
"legitimationsoplysninger. Hvis du er deltager, der publicerer og abonnerer "
"på fabric'en, er dette kapitel ikke din hverdag — din flade er "
"**[Hverdagsopgaver](everyday.md)** (`goat pub` / `sub` / `top` / `who` / "
"`health`). `goat admin` er **inaktiv for ikke-administratorer**: et "
"uautoriseret kald ændrer ingenting og oplyser dig om det."

#: src/admin.md:7
msgid "What \"operator-only\" means in practice"
msgstr "Hvad \"kun for operatører\" betyder i praksis"

#: src/admin.md:9
msgid ""
"The authority isn't in the CLI — it's in _your credentials_. `goat` itself "
"is a thin client; whether you may onboard an org or eject a peer is decided "
"by what your operator profile and environment carry, and confirmed by the "
"portal and the NetBird management API. So an admin command can stop in two "
"honest places:"
msgstr ""
"Autoriteten ligger ikke i CLI'en — den ligger i _dine "
"legitimationsoplysninger_. `goat` er selv en tynd klient; om du må onboarde "
"en organisation eller smide en peer ud afgøres af, hvad din operatørprofil "
"og dit miljø indeholder, og bekræftes af portalen og NetBird management "
"API'en. Så en admin-kommando kan stoppe to ærlige steder:"

#: src/admin.md:11
msgid ""
"**Up front, before anything is sent.** If your machine has no operator setup "
"at all — no initialized profile and no operator environment — `goat admin` "
"refuses immediately with `E_NOT_ADMIN`. Nothing leaves your laptop."
msgstr ""
"**På forhånd, inden noget sendes.** Hvis din maskine slet ikke har nogen "
"operatøropsætning — ingen initialiseret profil og intet operatørmiljø — "
"afviser `goat admin` øjeblikkeligt med `E_NOT_ADMIN`. Intet forlader din "
"laptop."

#: src/admin.md:12
msgid ""
"**Server-side, at the action.** If you do have credentials but they aren't "
"authorized for this action, the portal or NetBird returns a refusal. A "
"refused _mutation_ means nothing changed — and `goat` reports it as "
"`E_NOT_ADMIN`, not as a vague token error."
msgstr ""
"**Server-side, ved handlingen.** Hvis du har legitimationsoplysninger, men "
"de ikke er autoriseret til denne handling, returnerer portalen eller NetBird "
"en afvisning. En afvist _mutation_ betyder, at ingenting er ændret — og "
"`goat` rapporterer det som `E_NOT_ADMIN`, ikke som en vag token-fejl."

#: src/admin.md:14
msgid "Two error codes you'll want to tell apart:"
msgstr "To fejlkoder, du bør holde adskilt:"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "Code"
msgstr "Kode"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Betydning"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "What to do"
msgstr "Hvad du skal gøre"

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid "`E_NOT_ADMIN`"
msgstr "`E_NOT_ADMIN`"

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid ""
"Your credential is **valid but not authorized** for this action (or no "
"operator credential is configured)."
msgstr ""
"Din legitimation er **gyldig, men ikke autoriseret** til denne handling "
"(eller der er ingen operatørlegitimation konfigureret)."

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid ""
"Confirm you're on your operator profile and have sourced your operator "
"environment. If you still can't, this action isn't for your role — contact "
"your goat administrator. Re-onboarding won't change it."
msgstr ""
"Bekræft, at du er på din operatørprofil og har hentet dit operatørmiljø. "
"Hvis det stadig ikke virker, er denne handling ikke for din rolle — kontakt "
"din goat-administrator. Re-onboarding ændrer det ikke."

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "`E_TOKEN_INVALID`"
msgstr "`E_TOKEN_INVALID`"

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "Your credential is **expired or bad** (HTTP 401)."
msgstr "Din legitimation er **udløbet eller ugyldig** (HTTP 401)."

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "Re-onboard to get a fresh token."
msgstr "Re-onboard for at få et nyt token."

#: src/admin.md:21
msgid ""
"Reading about admin is never gated: `goat admin --help` and `goat admin "
"<cmd> --help` always work, in every language. Only _running_ an action is "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"Læsning om admin er aldrig spærret: `goat admin --help` og `goat admin <cmd> "
"--help` virker altid, på alle sprog. Kun _udførelse_ af en handling "
"kontrolleres."

#: src/admin.md:23
msgid "The commands"
msgstr "Kommandoerne"

#: src/admin.md:25
msgid ""
"Add `--help` to any of these for the full flag set, or see the **[Command "
"reference](reference.md)** — the details there are generated from the "
"binary, so they always match what you're running."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj `--help` til en af disse for det fulde flag-sæt, eller se "
"**[Kommandoreferencen](reference.md)** — detaljerne der er genereret fra "
"binærfilen, så de altid matcher det, du kører."

#: src/admin.md:41
msgid "A few notes:"
msgstr "Et par bemærkninger:"

#: src/admin.md:43
msgid ""
"**`lan` is the break-glass diagnostic.** `scan` and `doctor` mutate nothing, "
"need no credentials, and are built to work when the mesh and every service "
"are down — so they're the one part of `goat admin` that isn't refused for a "
"missing operator environment."
msgstr ""
"**`lan` er nøddiagnostikken.** `scan` og `doctor` muterer intet, kræver "
"ingen legitimationsoplysninger og er bygget til at fungere, når mesh-nettet "
"og alle tjenester er nede — så de er den eneste del af `goat admin`, der "
"ikke afvises ved et manglende operatørmiljø."

#: src/admin.md:44
msgid ""
"**`rotate` keeps identity fixed.** It re-issues the leaf certificate for the "
"same anchor, alias, write namespace, and ACL — only the cert and key are "
"new. Use it for renewal or re-keying, not for changing who someone is."
msgstr ""
"**`rotate` holder identiteten fast.** Den genudsteder bladcertifikatet for "
"samme anker, alias, skrivenavn og ACL — kun certifikat og nøgle er nye. Brug "
"den til fornyelse eller re-keying, ikke til at ændre, hvem nogen er."

#: src/admin.md:45
msgid ""
"**`peer cut` is the real cut.** On the brokerless fabric a certificate is "
"inert without a mesh path, so removing the _peer_ is what stops a flooder — "
"`goat health` finds it, `goat admin peer cut` ejects it."
msgstr ""
"**`peer cut` er det reelle snit.** På den mæglerløse fabric er et certifikat "
"inaktivt uden en mesh-sti, så fjernelse af _peeren_ er det, der stopper en "
"flooder — `goat health` finder den, `goat admin peer cut` smider den ud."

#: src/admin.md:46
msgid ""
"**Destructive actions confirm first.** `org delete`, `peer cut`, and the `--"
"org` cascades print what they're about to do and ask before acting (`--yes` "
"to skip, `--dry-run` to preview)."
msgstr ""
"**Destruktive handlinger bekræfter først.** `org delete`, `peer cut` og "
"`--org`-kaskaderne udskriver, hvad de er ved at gøre, og spørger inden de "
"handler (`--yes` for at springe over, `--dry-run` for forhåndsvisning)."

#: src/admin.md:48
msgid "If you see `E_NOT_ADMIN`"
msgstr "Hvis du ser `E_NOT_ADMIN`"

#: src/admin.md:50
msgid "Nothing was changed. Walk through it:"
msgstr "Intet blev ændret. Gå igennem det:"

#: src/admin.md:52
msgid ""
"**Are you on your operator profile?** `goat context use <name>` selects it; "
"`goat profile show` confirms which one is active."
msgstr ""
"**Er du på din operatørprofil?** `goat context use <name>` vælger den; `goat "
"profile show` bekræfter, hvilken der er aktiv."

#: src/admin.md:53
msgid ""
"**Have you sourced your operator environment?** Admin actions read operator "
"credentials from the environment (for example `GOAT_OPERATOR_HANDLE` and the "
"NetBird admin token) — never from the profile on disk."
msgstr ""
"**Har du hentet dit operatørmiljø?** Admin-handlinger læser "
"operatørlegitimationsoplysninger fra miljøet (f.eks. `GOAT_OPERATOR_HANDLE` "
"og NetBird admin-tokenet) — aldrig fra profilen på disk."

#: src/admin.md:54
msgid ""
"**Should you have this access at all?** If you've checked the above and the "
"portal still refuses, your role isn't authorized for this action. Contact "
"your goat administrator — re-onboarding the same identity won't grant it."
msgstr ""
"**Burde du overhovedet have denne adgang?** Hvis du har kontrolleret "
"ovenstående og portalen stadig afviser, er din rolle ikke autoriseret til "
"denne handling. Kontakt din goat-administrator — re-onboarding af samme "
"identitet giver den ikke."

#: src/admin.md:56
msgid "The full operator workflow"
msgstr "Det fulde operatørworkflow"

#: src/admin.md:58
msgid ""
"This chapter orients you to the surface and how it behaves. The end-to-end "
"operator workflow — the capability model, setting up your environment and "
"certificates, and the onboard / revoke / rotate / audit loop — lives in the "
"**admin-operator guide** that ships with your goatnet's operations docs, not "
"in this book."
msgstr ""
"Dette kapitel orienterer dig om fladen og dens adfærd. Det ende-til-ende "
"operatørworkflow — kapabilitetsmodellen, opsætning af dit miljø og "
"certifikater samt onboard / revoke / rotate / audit-løkken — findes i "
"**admin-operatørguiden**, der følger med dit goatnet's driftsdokumentation, "
"ikke i denne bog."

